WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Reset your Axis Meter password.

00:02.500 --> 00:11.816
Enter your account email at myaccount.axismeter.com,
then select Continue.

00:11.816 --> 00:15.534
Select Forgot password?

00:15.534 --> 00:20.334
Select Reset your password to receive a code.

00:20.334 --> 00:24.335
Check your email for the six-digit code.
Check your junk folder too.

00:24.335 --> 00:31.001
Enter the six-digit code from your email.
The code is hidden in this demonstration.

00:31.001 --> 00:46.295
Choose a strong new password and enter it again
in Confirm password.

00:46.295 --> 00:50.200
Select Reset Password to save your new password.

00:50.200 --> 00:55.167
Password reset complete.
Your new password is ready to use.
